# Vite writes this transient file beside the config while loading a TS config,
# and leaves it behind if the process dies. Regenerable, never meaningful.
vite.config.ts.timestamp-*
vitest.config.ts.timestamp-*

# Only produced by `vitest run --coverage`, which is one flag away.
coverage/

# NOT listed, because measured 2026-09-06 and they cannot land here:
# `tsconfig.*.json` already redirect tsBuildInfoFile into `node_modules/.tmp/`,
# and Vite's cacheDir defaults to `node_modules/.vite` - both already ignored.
